      "side": 1,
      "message": "This feels a bit complicated, can we turn this into a choice?\n\n```\nchoice HW_TEST_MODE\n  default HW_TEST_MODE_OFF\n\nconfig HW_TEST_MODE_OFF\n  bool \"Don\u0027t use hardware tests\"\n  \nconfig HW_TEST_MODE_RW_ONLY\n  bool \"Only run tests in RW\"\n  \nconfig HW_TEST_MODE_RO_RW\n  bool \"Run tests in both RO and RW\"\n\nendchoice # HW_TEST_MODE\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "48218338c90f91a419c4fdf48e681e1d49f8ec46",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
